  {
    "ref": "U00299",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e297]: Long-lasting power and innovation is what the Energizer Max family is all about. Energizer C batteries hold power for up to 10 years while in storage, so you have power when you need it most. When it comes to toys, digital cameras, and other valuable devices, you can feel confident knowing you have the long-lasting power and protection you expect from Energizer. Even fully used AA and AAA sizes are designed to protect your devices from leakage - for up to 2 years."
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00300",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e298]: 8 pack of Energizer MAX C Batteries, Batteries C Size"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00301",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e299]: These alkaline C batteries provide long lasting power for your everyday devices"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00302",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e300]: The power you depend on for high-tech C battery flashlights, radios, toys and other high-drain devices"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00303",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e301]: Long lasting batteries hold power for up to 10 years in storage"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00304",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e302]: C Alkaline batteries that are made to last. Not to leak"
  },
